    "justification": "O4 replaces the strict decomposition of Num2Bits_strict (Num2Bits(254) with AliasCheck) by a 254-bit field-size decomposition without the alias check. The disturbance twin decomposes in + p instead of in, which has the same weighted sum modulo p but is not the canonical representation."
